# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-18
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Now we run Estimator. We would like to focus on the role of ZNE, and so we might want to set `resilience_level = 0` to avoid conflating effects of twirling with the effect of ZNE. However, we also want to compare our \"by-hand\" ZNE to the ZNE settings built into Qiskit, which include twirling. We thus set `resilience_level = 1` here. Setting `resilience_level = 2` invokes the Qiskit ZNE settings, which we will use shortly.\n"
msgstr "Ngayon patatakbuhin natin ang Estimator. Gusto nating tumuon sa papel ng ZNE, kaya maaaring gusto nating itakda ang `resilience_level = 0` para maiwasang mahalo ang mga epekto ng twirling sa epekto ng ZNE. Gayunpaman, gusto rin nating ikumpara ang \"by-hand\" na ZNE natin sa mga ZNE setting na built-in sa Qiskit, na may kasamang twirling. Kaya itinatakda natin dito ang `resilience_level = 1`. Ang pagtatakda ng `resilience_level = 2` ay nag-i-invoke sa mga ZNE setting ng Qiskit, na gagamitin natin sa ilang sandali.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-18
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Now we print out the noise levels and expectation values.\n"
msgstr "Ngayon ipi-print natin ang mga noise level at expectation value.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-18
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This is the part where we are being the most cavalier: we do a linear fit to these data without any attention being paid to the variance of each value we obtained, and without trying to theoretically predict whether the fit needs to be linear. Again, the built-in ZNE does a much better job than what we're doing by hand.\n"
msgstr "Ito ang bahaging pinakamapusok tayo: gumagawa tayo ng linear fit sa data na ito nang walang pagbibigay-pansin sa variance ng bawat halagang nakuha natin, at nang hindi sinusubukang hulaan nang teoretikal kung kailangang linear ang fit. Muli, mas mahusay ang ginagawa ng built-in na ZNE kaysa sa ginagawa natin nang mano-mano.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-18
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
